# The v3 build context is this repository's root. The recipe COPYs nothing
# from it; the kit frontend reads only gitguardian.yaml, gitguardian.dockerfile
# and the agent-context body. Allow exactly those, so nothing else - least of
# all the local .env holding a GitGuardian PAT - is ever sent to BuildKit.
*
!gitguardian.yaml
!gitguardian.dockerfile
!gitguardian-context.md
